# Flight-mode control scheme, ported from the other local reference
# project (~/Defold/SuperShips/input/game.input_binding) — see plan.md's
# new Controls section for what each action means and which are actually
# wired up to anything yet (flight mode itself isn't built, §4's "Build
# flight mode" TODO). This is a generic space-flight-sim control scheme
# (throttle/pitch/yaw, targeting, docking, FTL jump, camera, weapon
# toggles) — mechanics, not creative expression, so reuse is fine per §0,
# same as the rest of what's been ported from that project.
